## 7. Anti-Hallucination Strategy (Summary)

|Layer       |Defense                                                                          |
|------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Retrieval   |Symbol-granular embeddings; public-API boost in re-ranking                       |
|Prompt      |`generate_test` template forces `validate_call` before every emitted call        |
|Runtime tool|`validate_call` returns deterministic exists/matches verdict and fuzzy candidates|
|Surface     |Private symbols hidden by default; only `public_api=true` returned in `list_apis`|
|Post-gen    |Whole-file static validator re-checks every call against the symbol table        |
|Loop        |Failed validation is fed back into the agent loop with the structured error      |

Three independent layers (retrieval, in-loop validation, post-gen validation) must all fail for a hallucination to ship.

